0 points\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 are\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 larger\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 than\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 what\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 should\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 be\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 used\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 for good accuracy.\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 If the gap is large, the program will give you a warning message, where you can select to either continue to the next lobe, or redo the lobe just measured.\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 If you want to be as precise as possible, set this to Yes.\expnd8\expndtw40  \expnd0\expndtw0 If you just want to quickly check a cam for duration, lobe separation and lift, then set this to No.\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\f0\fs20\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\sl240\slmult1\sb1\f0\fs20\b0\i0\par\pard\plain\s10\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li806\sl240\slmult1\sb1\f1\fs28\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 Warn\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \expnd0\expndtw0 if\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \expnd0\expndtw0 High\expnd-1\expndtw-5  \expnd0\expndtw0 Accels\expnd-1\expndtw-6  \expnd0\expndtw-2 Found\par\pard\plain\s1\nooverflow\nocwrap\lnbrkrule\li806\ri444\sl244\slmult1\sb236\f0\fs20\b0\expnd0\expndtw0\charscalex100 After\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 you\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 measure\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 a\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 cam,\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 the\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 program\expnd-1\expndtw-3  \expnd0\expndtw0 checks\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 if\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 there\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 a\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 \'93bumps\'94\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 or\expnd0\expndtw-2  \expnd0\expndtw0 \'93dips\'94\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 in\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 the\expnd0\expndtw-1  \expnd0\expndtw0 lift\expnd0\expndtw-1  \